common ---> folder the contains common entities that could be used for extending other entities
        - orm lifecycle-hook (creating-created-updating-updated-saving-saved-deleting-deleted-retrieved)
        - global orm lc-hook (delete, insert, update, flush, destroy, save and fresh)
        - machine service lc-hook (error, isReady, isStarted, isExecuting, isDone, isError, isFinished)
        - constants

console ---> folder for the platform foundation.
                    - iBrains main UI, bootstrap-system related data to be cached. eg: meta-resource-plugins (connectos, widgets..)
                    - ibrains theming and constants
                    - files
                        - helpers (folder)
                        - entities (tenant + tenantList  full, simple, lite, list-simple, list-lite). including schemas for ui and schema for openapi
                        - constants (includes the constants)
                        - actions
                        - stories
                        - state (include entities + console global levels)
                        - dsl (domain-specific-language) to generate and assemble things together). eg: build a global state from collecting sub states from different places.
                        - index to link the dotes together


